# A viewer of a network game (docs/phase-network.md, the viewers): tools/ci.sh runs it with --watch 127.0.0.1 beside
# net_host.kps and net_join.kps, the host serving its game to viewers (--watch-delay 2: two seconds behind). The
# viewer's replay starts once the host's start file came and runs as far as the record holds; the host leaves at tick
# 400 and the viewer plays on to the record's end, its tick logged past the joiner's command (tick 40).
options originals
clock real
wait game within 120000
expect replay
log watching tick
wait tick >= 300 within 120000
log watched tick
quit
